Sun Aug 30 18:32:50 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Add 0001-Update-for-compat-with-newer-CMake.patch: upstream's only
  commit past the 0.1.1 tag; switches cmake_minimum_required to the
  2.8.12...3.10 range form, which cmake 4 accepts without the
  distro-wide CMAKE_POLICY_VERSION_MINIMUM escape hatch.
- Fix License to GPL-3.0-or-later: the source header grants v3 "or (at
  your option) any later version".
- Spec cleanup: drop Group tags, switch to %autosetup, add %check,
  ship Changelog.txt.
- Explicitly require soapy-sdr: the automatic soname dependency pulls
  only libSoapySDR, so the module could be installed with no SoapySDR
  client - not even SoapySDRUtil - to reach it

